      "blurb": "Non-Elemental: Beast Imitating Art: Bat/Snake (D-Rank)",
      "summonRole": "Ink Bat/Snake",
      "biography": "<p><em>Beast Imitating Art: Bat/Snake (D-Rank) (Non-Elemental Ninjutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC. You command it as a Bonus Action; it can take reactions it's able to, such as opportunity attacks.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 12 + 2 for every rank above D-Rank · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 15 + 8 for every rank above D-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft., 30 ft. fly.</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +3 (save +1), DEX +2 (save +1), CON +2 (save +1), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA +5 (save −5). <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental and Sensory, Incapacitated. <strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 30 ft., passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
